An extensible Model Context Protocol for Isabelle
=================================================

The first goal of this project is to build an Isabelle tool that allows agents to interact with Isabelle.

The second goal of this project is to make the MCP server extensible by writing Isabelle/ML tools and registering them with the server. As an example consider the following theory. It imports the MCP commands mcp_tool and mcp_resource to register a tool called find_consts and a resource called sessions.

```
theory BasicTool
imports MCP
begin

mcp_tool find_consts "..."

mcp_resource sessions "..."
end
```

These tools are then available to the agent.
